  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/284538/description_e0078bde-6183-467f-beab-193186c6ce05.png\" alt=\"战火召唤\" width=\"850\" height=\"286\"></p><p>战火召唤现已通过本扩展包加入载具系统！</p><p><strong>还没有战火召唤？这是一款宏大的二战题材全面改造模组！立即获取：</strong><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/call-to-battle-2-authentic-world-war-2-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/call-to-battle-2-authentic-world-war-2-experience</a></p><h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/284830/description_39766cea-40dd-47ee-942f-0b07c05ae569.png\" alt=\"模组概览\" width=\"850\" height=\"84\"></h2><p>战火召唤载具扩展专注于打造优化良好、操作简便的载具体验，完美契合《我的世界》的方块物理特性，而非强行模拟现实物理效果。</p><p>目前已加入威利斯MB吉普、桶车等多功能载具，欧宝闪电、CCKW等运兵卡车，更多载具即将登场！ :)</p><h2>衍生型号</h2><p>威利斯MB与桶车均有机枪改装型号。威利斯配备中置勃朗宁M1919a4机枪，桶车则搭载侧置MG-34机枪。更多武装型号开发中！</p><p>另有采用苏联涂装与标识的《租借法案》版威利斯MB吉普！</p><h2>多人游戏</h2><p>这些载具已部署至战火召唤官方服务器的多张地图！通过团队协作可解锁更多载具及其变体。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/284538/description_e9b0ade0-7f18-4ec0-8467-668fe7fc5302.png\" alt=\"社交平台\" width=\"850\" height=\"84\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/invite/gGn8vMBukq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/284538/description_e21e999c-49ea-4455-b97d-fbcfc72ec6bf.png\" alt=\"Discord社区\" width=\"255\" height=\"48\"></strong></a></p><p><strong>加入Discord：</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/invite/gGn8vMBukq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/invite/gGn8vMBukq</a></p><p><strong>YouTube频道：</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZy0qJo1n88ezfSoICGO8DA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZy0qJo1n88ezfSoICGO8DA</a></p><p><strong>Instagram：</strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fcalltobattleofficial%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.instagra